    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Marbies Party</strong> is a chaotic local <strong>party game</strong> playable from <strong>2 to 4</strong>, in which you play as silly little rounded characters running around mazes. Get in your opponents' way as you play a variety of game modes all the way to victory! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FUN AND CHAOS WITH FRIENDS \u25d5\u203f\u25d5</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players, locally or online using <strong>Steam Remote Play Together</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTER CUSTOMIZATION \u25d5\u203f\u25d5</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/f90e0101d1c0ad6be1082a5a024a7da6.poster.avif?t=1748263937\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/f90e0101d1c0ad6be1082a5a024a7da6.webm?t=1748263937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/f90e0101d1c0ad6be1082a5a024a7da6.mp4?t=1748263937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own unique Marbie before jumping in!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROCEDURALLY GENERATED MAZES \u25d5\u203f\u25d5</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/bc298ae73cfbfa802061a1a79cc9b472.poster.avif?t=1748263937\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/bc298ae73cfbfa802061a1a79cc9b472.webm?t=1748263937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/bc298ae73cfbfa802061a1a79cc9b472.mp4?t=1748263937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new maze is generated each time you play: every game is unique!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VARIOUS THEMES \u25d5\u203f\u25d5</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chose from a selection of themes to change the scenery, or leave it to chance!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FACE YOUR FRIENDS IN A VARIETY OF GAME MODES \u25d5\u203f\u25d5</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COINS RUSH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/8c7854671610e314fdeabc1cae9ee4f5.poster.avif?t=1748263937\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/8c7854671610e314fdeabc1cae9ee4f5.webm?t=1748263937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/8c7854671610e314fdeabc1cae9ee4f5.mp4?t=1748263937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect as many coins as possible and jump into the hole at the center of the maze to score them. Smash crates to obtain unique power-ups that will help you beat your opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RACE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the other end of the maze before your opponents to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(following modes not included in the demo)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLINDFOLDED</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to find your way in the dark before your opponents to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BATTLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for your life in the maze and hit as many opponents as you can to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BATTLE ROYALE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The last Marbie standing wins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MARBALL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basically play football... except <i>you</i> are the ball. Score as many points as you can to beat the other team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DRAWING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reproduce the picture as best you can by rolling in the snow. The most accurate artist wins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SKILL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll you way to the opposite side of the maze without falling!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4F 4E 45 20 4D 4F 52 45 20 54 48 49 4E 47 \u25d5\u203f\u25d5</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >54 68 65 72 65 20 6D 61 79 20 62 65 20 6D 6F 72 65 20 74 68 61 6E 20 6D 65 65 74 73 20 74 68 65 20 65 79 65</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Marbies Party</strong> is a chaotic local <strong>party game</strong> playable from <strong>2 to 4</strong>, in which you play as silly little rounded characters running around mazes. Get in your opponents' way as you play a variety of game modes all the way to victory! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FUN AND CHAOS WITH FRIENDS \u25d5\u203f\u25d5</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players, locally or online using <strong>Steam Remote Play Together</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTER CUSTOMIZATION \u25d5\u203f\u25d5</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/f90e0101d1c0ad6be1082a5a024a7da6.poster.avif?t=1748263937\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/f90e0101d1c0ad6be1082a5a024a7da6.webm?t=1748263937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/f90e0101d1c0ad6be1082a5a024a7da6.mp4?t=1748263937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own unique Marbie before jumping in!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROCEDURALLY GENERATED MAZES \u25d5\u203f\u25d5</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/bc298ae73cfbfa802061a1a79cc9b472.poster.avif?t=1748263937\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/bc298ae73cfbfa802061a1a79cc9b472.webm?t=1748263937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/bc298ae73cfbfa802061a1a79cc9b472.mp4?t=1748263937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new maze is generated each time you play: every game is unique!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VARIOUS THEMES \u25d5\u203f\u25d5</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chose from a selection of themes to change the scenery, or leave it to chance!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FACE YOUR FRIENDS IN A VARIETY OF GAME MODES \u25d5\u203f\u25d5</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COINS RUSH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/8c7854671610e314fdeabc1cae9ee4f5.poster.avif?t=1748263937\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/8c7854671610e314fdeabc1cae9ee4f5.webm?t=1748263937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/8c7854671610e314fdeabc1cae9ee4f5.mp4?t=1748263937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect as many coins as possible and jump into the hole at the center of the maze to score them. Smash crates to obtain unique power-ups that will help you beat your opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RACE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the other end of the maze before your opponents to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(following modes not included in the demo)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLINDFOLDED</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to find your way in the dark before your opponents to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BATTLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for your life in the maze and hit as many opponents as you can to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"